OL,3,GNEWSATraders' tools stolen every 20
OL,4,Aminutes in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders' tools worth thousands of
OL,7,Fpounds were stolen somewhere in the UK
OL,8,Fevery 20 minutes last year, figures
OL,9,Fshow.
OL,11,FAt least 26,164 tool thefts were
OL,12,Frecorded in 2025, based on responses
OL,13,Ffrom 30 police forces who shared data.
OL,14,FThe true figure is likely to be higher
OL,15,Fas a further 15 forces could not
OL,16,Frespond.
OL,18,FGangs and "chancers" are behind the
OL,19,Fcrimes, according to Labour MP Amanda
OL,20,FMartin, who is calling for her
OL,21,Fgovernment to do more to help.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
