OL,3,GNEWSATraders' tools stolen every 20
OL,4,Aminutes in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said it was "working
OL,7,Fwith the police to tackle and prevent
OL,8,Ftool theft to protect more hardworking
OL,9,Ftradespeople", including increasing
OL,10,Fneighbourhood policing, investing in
OL,11,Fpolice and working with industry and AI
OL,12,Fto tackle the sale of stolen goods.
